Text: The notice must—
(a)	give details of the Requirement or its variation;
(b)	state the Regulator's reasons for the imposition or variation of the Requirement;
(c)	inform A that A may make representations to the Regulator within such period as may be specified in the notice (whether or not A has referred the matter to the Appeals Committee);
(d)	inform A of when the imposition or variation of the Requirement takes effect; and
(e)	inform A of A's right to refer the matter to the Appeals Panel.

