Text: In order to enable an affected person to exercise their right to refer our decision to the Appeals Panel, we will provide such a person with written notice of the decision specifying:
(a)	our decision and the reasons for making that decision;
(b)	the date on which the decision is to take effect;
(c)	the person's right to seek a review of the decision by the Appeals Panel.
